// newtqbeLabelInputLine: a "query by example" labelled input line: what the user
// writes is not stored but looked up in the application's soup (newtTextFilter's
// PathQuery), and the first entry holding it is gone to and shown.  Not in the NPR.
//
// This file holds newtqbeLabelInputLine and what only it reaches.

// flavor: the NewtApp filter that makes and reads the text (newtFilter)
// access 'queryOnly: text written only looks entries up (newtProtoLineBase's viewIdleScript); usePopup nil:
// the matches are not offered in a popup
newtqbeLabelInputLine := {_proto: @newtProtoLine, flavor: @newtTextFilter, access: 'queryOnly, usePopup: nil};
